"text": "Facebook told me why my videos weren't growing.\nOpen your Professional dashboard, and check each post's summary.\nTip one: no borders.\nFacebook says borders look like reposted content, so they may get less reach.\nTip two: hook people fast, because fewer people watched this one past twenty seconds.\nTip three: keep Reels under fifteen seconds.\nMine got a hundred and fifty-nine percent more views.\nTip four: protect your videos.\nWith content protection, Facebook shows you when someone reposts your video, and you can hide it from everyone.\nFollow for more growth tips."
